# Aegis Laptop Diagnostics - Portable Mode Configuration
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# When this marker file is present, Aegis runs in zero-trace portable USB mode.
# All inspection databases and generated HTML reports are kept encapsulated
# within this directory structure:
#
#   ./aegis_data/inspections.sqlite3   <- Local inspection history on USB
#   ./aegis_reports/                   <- Exported HTML/JSON buyer reports
#
# No files, logs, or cache directories are written to the host computer's
# user profile, %APPDATA%, or ~/.local/share/.
